WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
I’m your Hama Movie! buddy.
Let’s find a film together!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Type a film’s name.
Then tap Search. Easy!

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Tap a film title!
I’ll show you where and when it’s on.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Tap a screening to visit the cinema’s site.
Get your tickets there!

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Like the look of a film?
Tap its star to save it for later!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Tap Add to plans to save your outing!
Remember to book tickets separately.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Check your group’s plans and watchlist,
all in one place!

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Tap JP / EN to switch languages.
Let’s go enjoy a movie!
